# StayFinder API requests - preparation template
# Run one request at a time against your DEVELOPMENT database.
# Sections marked PLANNED are not implemented or verified yet.
# Expected results below are targets, not recorded test outcomes.
# Replace fixture IDs and dates with your own dedicated test records.
# Keep actual credentials/cookies in local tooling, never in this file.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@frontendOrigin = http://localhost:3001
@propertyId = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_PROPERTY_UUID
@bookingId = REPLACE_WITH_TEST_BOOKING_UUID
@otherBookingId = REPLACE_WITH_OTHER_GUEST_BOOKING_UUID
@missingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ownerCookies = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_OWNER_COOKIE_HEADER
@guestCookies = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_GUEST_A_COOKIE_HEADER
@otherGuestCookies = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_GUEST_B_COOKIE_HEADER
@checkIn = 2030-06-10
@checkOut = 2030-06-13
# dates must be future dates when running; configure the overlap fixture below.

### CURRENT: API status - expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### CURRENT: property list - expected 200, array
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties

### CURRENT: property details - expected 200, object (replace propertyId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{propertyId}}

### CURRENT: missing property - expected 404 (ensure missingId is absent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{missingId}}

### CURRENT: missing route - expected 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/route-that-does-not-exist

### CURRENT: invalid booking body - expected 400 with validation errors
# After authentication is implemented, add guest cookies to reach validation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Origin: {{frontendOrigin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{propertyId}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Guest",
  "guest_email": "not-an-email",
  "check_in": "{{checkIn}}",
  "check_out": "{{checkOut}}",
  "guests": 0
}

